{"id":"n87530-1-7","stage":4,"title":"후임 · 后任","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87530-1-7-1","ko":"후임 부장을 뽑는다는 얘기가 있던데요?","zh":"听说要选接任的部长？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"후임","meaning":"后任，继任，继任者","explanation":"후임：后任，继任，继任者","readings":[{"term":"후임","audio":"/audio/ac5a8e06c18ee457c950.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87530","senseId":"1","lemma":"후임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부장을","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뽑는다는","meaning":"选拔，选","explanation":"뽑다：选拔，选；는다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"뽑다","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26962","senseId":"4","lemma":"뽑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얘기가","meaning":"消息","explanation":"얘기：消息；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"4","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던데요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac5a8e06c18ee457","term":"후임","zh":"后任，继任，继任者","audio":"/audio/ac5a8e06c18ee457c950.mp3","entryId":"87530","definition":"之前负责某件事情的人去职后接任此事情；或指此人或事。","pronunciation":["후ː임"]},{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"8fe05f49afd4379a","term":"뽑다","zh":"选拔，选","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3","entryId":"26962","definition":"为某个目标而选出。","pronunciation":["뽑따"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"某些东西的传闻或评判。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/366fe5907ede775523ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87530-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 이 부장님은 회사를 나가시는 거예요?","zh":"那李部长要离开公司了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부장님은","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가시는","meaning":"离开","explanation":"나가다：离开；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"10","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间，或曾所属的地方出去。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/05156a0540753a451f25.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87530","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那李部长要离开公司了吗？","个性化服务提供便利的同时，也要求大量信息。","听说要选接任的部长？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那李部长要离开公司了吗？","听说要选接任的部长？","个性化服务提供便利的同时，也要求大量信息。"],"answer":0}]}
